title: "Plant Prime Editor"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A browser-based platform for plant prime editing that carries a design from
  allele comparison through pegRNA construction to a cloning-ready primer set.
  All computation runs client-side; no sequence leaves the browser.
